       01 WS-WITH-MODEL      GLOBAL PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-AGENTS-ON       GLOBAL PIC 9 VALUE 0.
       01 WS-NE2             GLOBAL PIC Z(3)9.
]]></working-storage>
